1
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,270
♪I stretch and yawn
when the sun is high in the sky♪

2
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,030
♪A cup of tea and a little tune,
what a carefree life♪

3
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:28,480
♪The fortune teller said
love would come my way this year♪

4
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:32,580
♪But all I see is my food
arriving right on time♪

5
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,670
♪No rush, no worries♪

6
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,360
♪Love is all a matter of chance♪

7
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,480
♪Flowers bloom and fade♪

8
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,380
♪I'd rather take good care
of myself first♪

9
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,580
♪Two orioles sing among
the green willows♪

10
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,970
♪And I still don't have a boyfriend♪

11
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,590
♪My best years are nothing
to worry about♪

12
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,240
♪I'll stay happily single
till I'm old and gray♪

13
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,540
=Besties' Coming Fortune=

14
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,980
=Episode 18=

15
00:01:17,350 --> 00:01:18,950
Wow, it's really flying.

16
00:01:19,950 --> 00:01:21,080
It's so beautiful.

17
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:24,670
I heard

18
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:25,680
the higher it flies,

19
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:27,150
the sooner your wish will come true.

20
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:30,480
Make a wish, Shutiao.

21
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:32,510
Hurry.

22
00:01:33,310 --> 00:01:33,670
Okay.

23
00:01:43,870 --> 00:01:45,080
I wish...

24
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:15,790
He.

25
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:19,880
Cheng.

26
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,510
Do you think they'll hate us?

27
00:02:25,030 --> 00:02:26,040
At least if they hate us,

28
00:02:27,430 --> 00:02:28,640
they won't get themselves killed.

29
00:02:47,470 --> 00:02:48,480
My neck hurts.

30
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:52,550
Shutiao.

31
00:02:58,190 --> 00:02:59,920
Have we been transported again?

32
00:03:02,660 --> 00:03:03,180
(Divorce Agreement)

33
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,360
A divorce agreement?

34
00:03:11,060 --> 00:03:11,660
(Signed by Shen He)

35
00:03:13,980 --> 00:03:15,060
(Signed by Shen Cheng)

36
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:17,920
I've got one too.

37
00:03:19,630 --> 00:03:21,080
What's wrong with those two?

38
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:23,710
Yesterday, we were happily

39
00:03:23,710 --> 00:03:24,440
releasing lanterns together.

40
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:25,870
Today, without a word, they

41
00:03:25,870 --> 00:03:27,190
packed us off in a carriage.

42
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:28,470
Do they think we're delivery riders?

43
00:03:28,470 --> 00:03:29,760
That a note is all it takes?

44
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,110
Why does it feel

45
00:03:35,980 --> 00:03:37,190
so cold behind me?

46
00:03:37,190 --> 00:03:37,670
Wait.

47
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,550
Shen He may have
a strange way of thinking,

48
00:03:40,910 --> 00:03:42,550
(Divorce Agreement)
but he'd never do something like this.

49
00:03:43,470 --> 00:03:45,440
If Shen Cheng wanted to leave me,

50
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:47,480
he'd definitely tell me to my face.

51
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:49,030
He wouldn't sneak around

52
00:03:49,030 --> 00:03:49,710
and knock me unconscious.

53
00:03:50,490 --> 00:03:52,020
- Something's definitely wrong.
- Something's definitely wrong.

54
00:03:53,630 --> 00:03:54,110
Cheng.

55
00:03:55,310 --> 00:03:56,480
Those two women

56
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,670
could blow up a pleasure boat together

57
00:03:59,150 --> 00:04:00,950
and slap Xiang
until her face swelled like a pig's.

58
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,440
You sent them away.

59
00:04:03,590 --> 00:04:04,390
Do you really think

60
00:04:04,520 --> 00:04:05,230
they won't come back?

61
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,710
I sent Sanqi to escort them.

62
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:08,390
They won't be coming back.

63
00:04:16,830 --> 00:04:18,320
- Where are the horses?
- Where are the horses?

64
00:04:19,430 --> 00:04:20,240
Who would do something so rotten

65
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,320
as to unhitch my horses?

66
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:27,000
There's a manor over there.

67
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:28,510
Come on.

68
00:04:28,750 --> 00:04:29,390
Let's take a look.

69
00:04:38,830 --> 00:04:39,640
There's a horse.

70
00:04:40,070 --> 00:04:40,470
Help.

71
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:41,470
Help!

72
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:44,560
We haven't done anything.

73
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,920
Why are you trying to kill us?

74
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:46,760
You can ask

75
00:04:47,630 --> 00:04:48,590
the King of Hell when you get there.

76
00:04:58,750 --> 00:05:00,320
What's in that bundle of yours?

77
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:01,560
It packs quite a punch.

78
00:05:05,510 --> 00:05:06,680
See? I told you.

79
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:08,070
There's nothing in this world

80
00:05:08,070 --> 00:05:09,440
money can't solve.

81
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:12,710
Come on.

82
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:13,710
Here.

83
00:05:17,630 --> 00:05:18,640
Thank you both for saving us.

84
00:05:19,390 --> 00:05:20,390
My name is Xiaozhi.

85
00:05:20,750 --> 00:05:21,680
This is my sister.

86
00:05:22,270 --> 00:05:23,040
We came to the capital

87
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,120
to seek help from an old acquaintance.

88
00:05:24,630 --> 00:05:25,640
You're heading to the capital?

89
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,240
What a coincidence.

90
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,000
So are we.

91
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:31,200
I saw a horse in the yard.

92
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:32,560
Let's travel together.

93
00:05:38,630 --> 00:05:39,350
I'll go get the horse.

94
00:05:39,630 --> 00:05:39,870
Come on.

95
00:05:39,870 --> 00:05:40,470
Help her along.

96
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:48,000
Die!

97
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:55,710
Let's hurry.

98
00:05:55,950 --> 00:05:56,680
It's not safe to stay here.

99
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:58,440
Let's go.

100
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:17,070
We're rich.

101
00:06:17,070 --> 00:06:17,800
We're rich.

102
00:06:22,200 --> 00:06:25,290
♪The bamboo sways to lively melodies♪

103
00:06:25,760 --> 00:06:28,510
♪The evening breeze
gently plays with your hair♪

104
00:06:29,180 --> 00:06:32,640
♪Time stands still with you so close♪

105
00:06:32,910 --> 00:06:35,520
♪I can't bear to disturb this moment♪

106
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:39,070
♪As the years whisper
softly by your ear♪

107
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:42,550
♪They murmur life's
most tender affections♪

108
00:06:43,440 --> 00:06:46,880
♪Even if the world outside
changes beyond recognition♪

109
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:49,880
♪My heartbeat will lull you to sleep♪

110
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,120
I wonder

111
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:54,120
if he'll like it.

112
00:06:57,300 --> 00:07:01,270
♪By the cold moonlight, we form a bond♪

113
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:04,390
♪You're the forever I can hold on to♪

114
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:08,400
♪Beside your ear♪

115
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,910
♪You are my♪

116
00:07:13,150 --> 00:07:17,080
♪Promise of forever♪

117
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:19,880
Cheng.

118
00:07:21,190 --> 00:07:21,830
The antidote is ready.

119
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:23,150
Our men are all assembled.

120
00:07:33,950 --> 00:07:34,390
Cheng.

121
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:35,560
Until now,

122
00:07:36,070 --> 00:07:37,120
you've always protected me.

123
00:07:37,950 --> 00:07:39,240
Today, you can lead the way
without worry.

124
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,350
I'll watch your back.

125
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:51,880
Great, we have a horse.

126
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:03,880
Where's my wheel?

127
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:06,080
Who stole my wheel?

128
00:08:06,950 --> 00:08:07,950
How rotten!

129
00:08:10,510 --> 00:08:11,270
Wait.

130
00:08:13,070 --> 00:08:14,470
Something doesn't add up.

131
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:19,720
That man in black

132
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:20,560
was clutching his stomach

133
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:21,440
when he fell.

134
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:25,480
But you clearly hit him

135
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:26,640
in the back of the head
with your bundle.

136
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,640
Why would he clutch his stomach
after being hit in the head?

137
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,470
You mean...

138
00:08:35,150 --> 00:08:36,200
Someone must have been

139
00:08:36,670 --> 00:08:38,680
secretly protecting us this whole way.

140
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:40,960
Want to find out who?

141
00:08:41,750 --> 00:08:42,680
Easy.

142
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,470
Let's put on an act.

143
00:08:58,600 --> 00:08:59,350
Yuyuan!

144
00:09:00,030 --> 00:09:00,320
Yuyuan!

145
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:01,160
What's wrong?

146
00:09:01,670 --> 00:09:03,270
- I...
- Were you just hit by a hidden weapon

147
00:09:03,270 --> 00:09:04,560
and injured?

148
00:09:05,270 --> 00:09:07,080
- Sis.
- It hurts.

149
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:08,630
What am I going to do if you die?

150
00:09:08,630 --> 00:09:09,200
Your Ladyship!

151
00:09:09,910 --> 00:09:10,990
Your Ladyship, are you all right?

152
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:12,080
Where are you hurt?

153
00:09:12,390 --> 00:09:13,110
Let me take a look.

154
00:09:16,910 --> 00:09:17,590
I fell for it.

155
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:18,320
Come back here.

156
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:20,710
You've been hiding pretty well.

157
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:22,030
Enjoyed the show?

158
00:09:22,030 --> 00:09:23,560
What's going on?

159
00:09:23,910 --> 00:09:24,630
Tell us everything right now!

160
00:09:25,510 --> 00:09:25,990
Third Madam,

161
00:09:26,550 --> 00:09:27,390
there's no point asking me.

162
00:09:27,390 --> 00:09:28,350
I don't know anything.

163
00:09:29,030 --> 00:09:30,320
Even if you beat me to death,

164
00:09:30,550 --> 00:09:31,350
I won't...

165
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:33,520
Tell...

166
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:34,350
Tell...

167
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:35,520
I'll tell.

168
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:37,400
It's okay.

169
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,470
His Lordship has been working
in secret for years

170
00:09:39,670 --> 00:09:41,130
to uncover the truth

171
00:09:41,140 --> 00:09:42,830
behind the Marquis
and his wife's deaths.

172
00:09:43,270 --> 00:09:43,870
A few days ago,

173
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:45,080
he discovered that

174
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:46,800
the Third Prince was behind it all.

175
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:48,550
So His Lordship
and the Third Young Master

176
00:09:48,550 --> 00:09:49,230
decided

177
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:50,270
to make their move

178
00:09:50,270 --> 00:09:51,630
when the Third Prince visits
the imperial mausoleum.

179
00:09:56,750 --> 00:09:57,230
They...

180
00:09:58,480 --> 00:09:59,870
They never intended

181
00:09:59,870 --> 00:10:00,830
to come back alive.

182
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,790
That's why they gave you
divorce agreements

183
00:10:02,790 --> 00:10:03,750
and gold bars.

184
00:10:03,750 --> 00:10:05,110
They wanted you to leave

185
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:06,750
and go as far away as possible.

186
00:10:07,550 --> 00:10:09,110
He wants to be a tragic hero,

187
00:10:09,910 --> 00:10:11,560
but I have no intention
of becoming a grieving widow.

188
00:10:11,910 --> 00:10:13,920
I can't believe Shen He
went along with this madness.

189
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:15,560
We'll settle this with them later.

190
00:10:16,550 --> 00:10:17,750
Take us back right now.

191
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:19,080
Immediately.

192
00:10:19,510 --> 00:10:20,160
Right this minute.

193
00:10:20,510 --> 00:10:21,790
But His Lordship said...

194
00:10:21,790 --> 00:10:23,080
Would you rather be punished
by His Lordship,

195
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,520
or would you rather have us

196
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:27,320
beat you up again right now?

197
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:29,280
Then I'll put

198
00:10:29,670 --> 00:10:30,520
the wheel back on first.

199
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:40,080
Good heavens.

200
00:10:40,390 --> 00:10:41,680
How deep must this grudge be

201
00:10:41,870 --> 00:10:43,470
for someone to send assassins after you?

202
00:10:44,270 --> 00:10:46,350
Ever since we fled Qingzhou,

203
00:10:46,550 --> 00:10:48,230
people have kept coming after us.

204
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:50,870
I don't even know whom we've offended.

205
00:10:51,510 --> 00:10:53,230
They've chased you
all the way from Qingzhou?

206
00:10:53,750 --> 00:10:54,920
Hunting you across a thousand li?

207
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:56,670
Anyone would think

208
00:10:56,670 --> 00:10:58,440
you knew some earth-shattering secret.

209
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,870
Those people seem to be

210
00:10:59,870 --> 00:11:00,830
after my sister.

211
00:11:01,510 --> 00:11:03,440
But my sister has been
mentally impaired for years.

212
00:11:03,790 --> 00:11:04,990
She doesn't even recognize people.

213
00:11:05,150 --> 00:11:06,150
How could she have offended

214
00:11:06,150 --> 00:11:07,230
such vicious people?

215
00:11:35,870 --> 00:11:36,400
Assassins!

216
00:11:57,940 --> 00:12:00,260
♪No matter how
the universe changes tomorrow♪

217
00:12:00,260 --> 00:12:07,460
♪Right now,
I just want to stay by your side♪

218
00:12:07,460 --> 00:12:12,660
♪Let this kiss and this dream
last until we're old♪

219
00:12:13,860 --> 00:12:18,900
♪And hold on to all
the tenderness of this moment♪

220
00:12:20,260 --> 00:12:25,340
♪Following this heartbeat,
we'll retrace our steps♪

221
00:12:26,700 --> 00:12:31,820
♪As time goes by,
all I need is your gaze♪

222
00:12:33,100 --> 00:12:36,460
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪

223
00:12:55,220 --> 00:12:58,580
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪
